# SonicCross documentation

This directory is the documentation index. The authoritative documents live in
`design/`:

- [`SONICCROSS-SPEC.md`](../design/SONICCROSS-SPEC.md) — the frozen SonicCross semantic specification.
- [`SonicCross_Core_IR_v0_Frozen_Semantics.md`](../design/SonicCross_Core_IR_v0_Frozen_Semantics.md) — frozen Core IR (Semantic IR) record model and semantics.
- [`SonicCross_Core_IR_v0_Signature_Recovery.md`](../design/SonicCross_Core_IR_v0_Signature_Recovery.md) — how torchgen signature forms are recovered into the IR.
- [`SonicCross_Generation_Configuration_v0.md`](../design/SonicCross_Generation_Configuration_v0.md) — the default generation scope (dispatch keys, sharding, file managers) and the G1–G21 group map.
- [`SonicCross_Semantic_Differential_Test_v0.md`](../design/SonicCross_Semantic_Differential_Test_v0.md) — the differential test strategy.

Build, test, and differential-validation instructions are in the top-level
[`README.md`](../README.md).
